        "headline": "華航A350部分航機不提供Wi-Fi 免費上網資格依艙等與會員而異",
        "summary": "華航將A350列為提供Wi-Fi的機型，但部分A350暫無服務，A359代碼不保證可連線。可用航機上，經濟艙免費傳訊；豪華商務艙、豪華經濟艙及指定會員可免費瀏覽，其他瀏覽方案須付費，且無法讓未提供Wi-Fi的航機開通服務。",
        "headline_en": "China Airlines Offers Wi-Fi on Some, Not All, A350s; Free Access Varies",
        "summary_en": "China Airlines lists the A350 as a Wi-Fi-equipped type, but some A350s do not offer the service, and an A359 code does not guarantee connectivity. On equipped aircraft, Economy passengers get free messaging; Premium Business, Premium Economy and eligible members get free browsing. Other browsing plans are paid and cannot enable Wi-Fi on an unequipped aircraft.",
